{"route":"/references/data-foundations/","title":"Data Foundations Reference | Data Learning Hub","description":"Official references and glossary for Data Foundations.","canonical":"https://datalearninghub.netlify.app/references/data-foundations/","bodyAttrs":{"data-page":"tutorial-references","data-tutorial":"data-foundations"},"mainHtml":"<main id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"tutorial-layout\"><aside class=\"tutorial-sidebar\" id=\"tutorial-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-head\">\n<a class=\"tutorial-course-title\" data-bn=\"ডেটা ফাউন্ডেশন\" data-en=\"Data Foundations\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/\">Data Foundations</a>\n<button aria-label=\"Close chapter menu\" class=\"icon-button tutorial-drawer-close\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-close\" type=\"button\">×</button>\n</div>\n<label class=\"tutorial-sidebar-search\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Search chapters</span><input data-placeholder-bn=\"Chapter খুঁজুন…\" data-placeholder-en=\"Search chapters…\" id=\"tutorial-chapter-search\" placeholder=\"Search chapters…\" type=\"search\"/></label>\n<div class=\"tutorial-progress-mini\"><div><span data-bn=\"Course progress\" data-en=\"Course progress\">Course progress</span><strong id=\"tutorial-progress-label\">0/21</strong></div><div class=\"progress-track\"><span id=\"tutorial-progress-bar\" style=\"width:0\"></span></div></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"Course chapters\" class=\"tutorial-chapter-nav\"><div class=\"tutorial-module-links\"><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"welcome-to-data-analytics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/welcome-to-data-analytics/\"><span>01</span><span data-bn=\"ডেটা অ্যানালিটিক্সে স্বাগতম\" data-en=\"Welcome to Data Analytics\">Welcome to Data Analytics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-and-statistics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-and-statistics/\"><span>02</span><span data-bn=\"ডেটা ও স্ট্যাটিস্টিকস\" data-en=\"Data and Statistics\">Data and Statistics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"observations-variables-and-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/observations-variables-and-values/\"><span>03</span><span data-bn=\"Observation, Variable ও Value\" data-en=\"Observations, Variables, and Values\">Observations, Variables, and Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"rows-columns-tables-and-datasets\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/rows-columns-tables-and-datasets/\"><span>04</span><span data-bn=\"Row, Column, Table ও Dataset\" data-en=\"Rows, Columns, Tables, and Datasets\">Rows, Columns, Tables, and Datasets</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"categorical-and-numerical-data\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/categorical-and-numerical-data/\"><span>05</span><span data-bn=\"Categorical ও Numerical Data\" data-en=\"Categorical and Numerical Data\">Categorical and Numerical Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"discrete-and-continuous-data\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/discrete-and-continuous-data/\"><span>06</span><span data-bn=\"Discrete ও Continuous Data\" data-en=\"Discrete and Continuous Data\">Discrete and Continuous Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"measurement-scales\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/measurement-scales/\"><span>07</span><span data-bn=\"Measurement Scale\" data-en=\"Measurement Scales\">Measurement Scales</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-structures-and-formats\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-structures-and-formats/\"><span>08</span><span data-bn=\"Structured, Semi-structured ও Unstructured Data\" data-en=\"Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data\">Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-sources-and-collection\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/\"><span>09</span><span data-bn=\"Data Source ও Collection Method\" data-en=\"Data Sources and Collection Methods\">Data Sources and Collection Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"population-sample-parameter-and-statistic\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/population-sample-parameter-and-statistic/\"><span>10</span><span data-bn=\"Population, Sample, Parameter ও Statistic\" data-en=\"Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic\">Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"sampling-methods\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/\"><span>11</span><span data-bn=\"Sampling Method\" data-en=\"Sampling Methods\">Sampling Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"bias-confounding-and-error\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/bias-confounding-and-error/\"><span>12</span><span data-bn=\"Bias, Confounding ও Error\" data-en=\"Bias, Confounding, and Error\">Bias, Confounding, and Error</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-quality-dimensions\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><span>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside><div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div><article class=\"tutorial-content\"><header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Reference\" data-en=\"References\">References</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"ডেটা ফাউন্ডেশন Reference\" data-en=\"Data Foundations Reference\">Data Foundations Reference</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Course জুড়ে ব্যবহৃত definition, official source, download ও quick link।\" data-en=\"Definitions, official sources, downloads, and quick links used throughout the course.\">Definitions, official sources, downloads, and quick links used throughout the course.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header><section class=\"reference-source-grid\"><section class=\"reference-group\"><h2 data-bn=\"Statistics ও sampling\" data-en=\"Statistics and sampling\">Statistics and sampling</h2><ul><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/introductory-statistics-2e/pages/1-1-definitions-of-statistics-probability-and-key-terms\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>OpenStax — Definitions of Statistics, Probability, and Key Terms</strong><span>https://openstax.org/books/introductory-statistics-2e/pages/1-1-definitions-of-statistics-probability-and-key-terms</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/introductory-statistics-2e/pages/1-2-data-sampling-and-variation-in-data-and-sampling\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>OpenStax — Data, Sampling, and Variation</strong><span>https://openstax.org/books/introductory-statistics-2e/pages/1-2-data-sampling-and-variation-in-data-and-sampling</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/introductory-statistics-2e/pages/1-3-frequency-frequency-tables-and-levels-of-measurement\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>OpenStax — Frequency Tables and Levels of Measurement</strong><span>https://openstax.org/books/introductory-statistics-2e/pages/1-3-frequency-frequency-tables-and-levels-of-measurement</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.census.gov/topics/research/stat-research/expertise/survey-sampling.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>U.S. Census Bureau — Survey Sampling</strong><span>https://www.census.gov/topics/research/stat-research/expertise/survey-sampling.html</span></a></li></ul></section><section class=\"reference-group\"><h2 data-bn=\"Data analysis ও quality\" data-en=\"Data analysis and quality\">Data analysis and quality</h2><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/eda_d.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>NIST/SEMATECH — Exploratory Data Analysis</strong><span>https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/eda_d.htm</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/ppc/section4/ppc41.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>NIST/SEMATECH — First Steps in Data Analysis</strong><span>https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/ppc/section4/ppc41.htm</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://unstats.un.org/UNSDWebsite/data-quality\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>United Nations Statistics Division — Data Quality</strong><span>https://unstats.un.org/UNSDWebsite/data-quality</span></a></li></ul></section><section class=\"reference-group\"><h2 data-bn=\"Documentation, governance ও privacy\" data-en=\"Documentation, governance, and privacy\">Documentation, governance, and privacy</h2><ul><li><a href=\"https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/SpecialPublications/1500-18/NIST.SP.1500-18r2.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>NIST Research Data Framework</strong><span>https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/SpecialPublications/1500-18/NIST.SP.1500-18r2.html</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://ukdataservice.ac.uk/help/new-users/data-documentation/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>UK Data Service — Data Documentation</strong><span>https://ukdataservice.ac.uk/help/new-users/data-documentation/</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://ico.org.uk/for-organisations/uk-gdpr-guidance-and-resources/data-sharing/anonymisation/about-this-guidance/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>ICO — Anonymisation Guidance</strong><span>https://ico.org.uk/for-organisations/uk-gdpr-guidance-and-resources/data-sharing/anonymisation/about-this-guidance/</span></a></li></ul></section></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Quick reference</div><h2 data-bn=\"Course glossary\" data-en=\"Course glossary\">Course glossary</h2><div class=\"reference-term-grid\"><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Accuracy\" data-en=\"Accuracy\">Accuracy</h3><p data-bn=\"Recorded data reality বা trusted reference-এর কাছাকাছি হওয়া।\" data-en=\"Closeness of recorded data to reality or a trusted reference.\">Closeness of recorded data to reality or a trusted reference.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Analytical question\" data-en=\"Analytical question\">Analytical question</h3><p data-bn=\"যে প্রশ্ন data দিয়ে investigate করা যায় এবং যার population, measure, comparison বা time period নির্দিষ্ট।\" data-en=\"A question that can be investigated with data and has a defined population, measure, comparison, or time period.\">A question that can be investigated with data and has a defined population, measure, comparison, or time period.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Anonymisation\" data-en=\"Anonymisation\">Anonymisation</h3><p data-bn=\"Reasonably available means দিয়ে individual আর identifiable না থাকে এমন processing।\" data-en=\"Processing data so individuals are no longer identifiable with reasonably available means.\">Processing data so individuals are no longer identifiable with reasonably available means.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Bias\" data-en=\"Bias\">Bias</h3><p data-bn=\"Truth বা target quantity থেকে systematic deviation।\" data-en=\"Systematic deviation from the truth or target quantity.\">Systematic deviation from the truth or target quantity.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Bin\" data-en=\"Bin\">Bin</h3><p data-bn=\"Numerical value group করার interval।\" data-en=\"An interval used to group numerical values.\">An interval used to group numerical values.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Binary variable\" data-en=\"Binary variable\">Binary variable</h3><p data-bn=\"দুই state-এর categorical variable।\" data-en=\"A categorical variable with two states.\">A categorical variable with two states.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Bivariate\" data-en=\"Bivariate\">Bivariate</h3><p data-bn=\"দুই variable-এর relationship analysis।\" data-en=\"Analysis of the relationship between two variables.\">Analysis of the relationship between two variables.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Business key\" data-en=\"Business key\">Business key</h3><p data-bn=\"Context-এ entity বা event uniquely identify করা field।\" data-en=\"Fields that uniquely identify an entity or event in context.\">Fields that uniquely identify an entity or event in context.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"CSV\" data-en=\"CSV\">CSV</h3><p data-bn=\"Delimited tabular record-এর plain-text format।\" data-en=\"A plain-text format for delimited tabular records.\">A plain-text format for delimited tabular records.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Categorical variable\" data-en=\"Categorical variable\">Categorical variable</h3><p data-bn=\"যার value label বা group represent করে।\" data-en=\"A variable whose values represent labels or groups.\">A variable whose values represent labels or groups.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Change log\" data-en=\"Change log\">Change log</h3><p data-bn=\"Data-তে applied transformation ও correction-এর record।\" data-en=\"A record of transformations and corrections applied to data.\">A record of transformations and corrections applied to data.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Cluster sample\" data-en=\"Cluster sample\">Cluster sample</h3><p data-bn=\"Natural group sample, তারপর selected group-এর unit study।\" data-en=\"Natural groups are sampled, then units within selected groups are studied.\">Natural groups are sampled, then units within selected groups are studied.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Completeness\" data-en=\"Completeness\">Completeness</h3><p data-bn=\"Required record ও value-এর presence।\" data-en=\"Presence of required records and values.\">Presence of required records and values.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Confounder\" data-en=\"Confounder\">Confounder</h3><p data-bn=\"Exposure ও outcome উভয়ের সঙ্গে related variable যা association distort করে।\" data-en=\"A variable related to both an exposure and outcome that distorts their association.\">A variable related to both an exposure and outcome that distorts their association.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Consistency\" data-en=\"Consistency\">Consistency</h3><p data-bn=\"Data source-এর within ও across logical agreement।\" data-en=\"Logical agreement within and across data sources.\">Logical agreement within and across data sources.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Continuous\" data-en=\"Continuous\">Continuous</h3><p data-bn=\"Interval জুড়ে vary করতে পারে এমন measured numerical value।\" data-en=\"Measured numerical values that can vary across an interval.\">Measured numerical values that can vary across an interval.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Coverage\" data-en=\"Coverage\">Coverage</h3><p data-bn=\"Source-এ represented people, event, place ও period।\" data-en=\"The people, events, places, and periods represented by a source.\">The people, events, places, and periods represented by a source.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Cumulative frequency\" data-en=\"Cumulative frequency\">Cumulative frequency</h3><p data-bn=\"Ordered frequency-এর running total।\" data-en=\"Running total of ordered frequencies.\">Running total of ordered frequencies.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Data\" data-en=\"Data\">Data</h3><p data-bn=\"Meaning ও context-সহ recorded value বা observation।\" data-en=\"Recorded values or observations with meaning and context.\">Recorded values or observations with meaning and context.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Data audit\" data-en=\"Data audit\">Data audit</h3><p data-bn=\"Structure, quality, provenance ও fitness-for-use-এর documented review।\" data-en=\"A documented review of structure, quality, provenance, and fitness for use.\">A documented review of structure, quality, provenance, and fitness for use.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Data dictionary\" data-en=\"Data dictionary\">Data dictionary</h3><p data-bn=\"Field, unit, code ও valid value define করা reference।\" data-en=\"A reference that defines fields, units, codes, and valid values.\">A reference that defines fields, units, codes, and valid values.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Data minimization\" data-en=\"Data minimization\">Data minimization</h3><p data-bn=\"Defined purpose-এর জন্য necessary data-ই collect ও retain করা।\" data-en=\"Collecting and retaining only data necessary for a defined purpose.\">Collecting and retaining only data necessary for a defined purpose.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Dataset\" data-en=\"Dataset\">Dataset</h3><p data-bn=\"একটি purpose-এর জন্য prepared related data collection।\" data-en=\"A collection of related data prepared for a purpose.\">A collection of related data prepared for a purpose.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Denominator\" data-en=\"Denominator\">Denominator</h3><p data-bn=\"Rate বা proportion calculate করার eligible base।\" data-en=\"The eligible base used to calculate a rate or proportion.\">The eligible base used to calculate a rate or proportion.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Descriptive statistics\" data-en=\"Descriptive statistics\">Descriptive statistics</h3><p data-bn=\"Observed data summarize করার method।\" data-en=\"Methods that summarize the data actually observed.\">Methods that summarize the data actually observed.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Discrete\" data-en=\"Discrete\">Discrete</h3><p data-bn=\"Possible value-এর মধ্যে gap-সহ countable numerical value।\" data-en=\"Countable numerical values with gaps between possible values.\">Countable numerical values with gaps between possible values.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"EDA\" data-en=\"EDA\">EDA</h3><p data-bn=\"Summary ও visualization দিয়ে systematic data exploration।\" data-en=\"Systematic exploration of data using summaries and visualizations.\">Systematic exploration of data using summaries and visualizations.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Evidence\" data-en=\"Evidence\">Evidence</h3><p data-bn=\"কোনো claim-এর সঙ্গে relevant observed বা calculated information।\" data-en=\"Observed or calculated information relevant to a claim.\">Observed or calculated information relevant to a claim.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Fairness\" data-en=\"Fairness\">Fairness</h3><p data-bn=\"Data use unjustified unequal benefit, error বা harm তৈরি করে কি না assessment।\" data-en=\"Assessment of whether data use creates unjustified unequal benefits, errors, or harms.\">Assessment of whether data use creates unjustified unequal benefits, errors, or harms.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Frequency\" data-en=\"Frequency\">Frequency</h3><p data-bn=\"Category বা interval-এর observation count।\" data-en=\"The count of observations in a category or interval.\">The count of observations in a category or interval.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Grain\" data-en=\"Grain\">Grain</h3><p data-bn=\"এক row বা metric event-এর represented level।\" data-en=\"The level represented by one row or metric event.\">The level represented by one row or metric event.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Identifier\" data-en=\"Identifier\">Identifier</h3><p data-bn=\"Record uniquely distinguish করার field।\" data-en=\"A field used to uniquely distinguish records.\">A field used to uniquely distinguish records.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Inferential statistics\" data-en=\"Inferential statistics\">Inferential statistics</h3><p data-bn=\"Sample evidence ব্যবহার করে population সম্পর্কে reason করার method।\" data-en=\"Methods that use sample evidence to reason about a population.\">Methods that use sample evidence to reason about a population.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Insight\" data-en=\"Insight\">Insight</h3><p data-bn=\"শুধু number নয়, meaningful pattern-এর contextual explanation।\" data-en=\"A contextual explanation of a meaningful pattern, not just a number.\">A contextual explanation of a meaningful pattern, not just a number.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Interval\" data-en=\"Interval\">Interval</h3><p data-bn=\"Equal difference meaningful, কিন্তু zero absence নয়।\" data-en=\"Equal differences are meaningful, but zero is not an absence.\">Equal differences are meaningful, but zero is not an absence.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"Invalid value\" data-en=\"Invalid value\">Invalid value</h3><p data-bn=\"Documented rule violate করা value।\" data-en=\"A value that violates a documented rule.\">A value that violates a documented rule.</p></article><article class=\"reference-term\"><h3 data-bn=\"JSON\" data-en=\"JSON\">JSON</h3><p data-bn=\"Object, array ও nested key-value data-এর text format।\" data-en=\"A text format for objects, arrays, and nested key-value data.\">A text format for objects, arra